L000518	\subsection{finite-volume extrapolation for dineutron}
L000519	
L000520	Figure~\ref{fig:e2n-L} shows the finite-volume dependence of the two-neutron ground-state energy computed with the SU(4) interaction. To assess the infinite-volume limit we use an empirical exponential form,
