L000534	
L000535	The neutron-neutron $^1$S$_0$ scattering phase shift $\delta$, extracted from finite-volume two-neutron energies via L\"uscher’s method, is shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:phase-nn}. Results obtained with the SU(4) and N$^3$LO interactions are compared with experimental data~\cite{Stoks:1993tb}.
